	<key>readme</key>
	<string># Easydict Alfred Workflow

Look up words and translate text easily.

## Keywords

- `di {word}` - Look up word in dictionary
- `tr {text}` - Translate text

## Keyboard Shortcuts

- `Enter` - Copy result
- `⌥ Enter` - Play pronunciation
- `⌘ Enter` - Open in Eudic (dictionary only)

## Translation Services

### Free (enabled by default)
- DeepLX - High quality, no API key needed
- Bing - Stable, supports many languages

### Optional (needs configuration)
- Google - Needs proxy in China
- DeepL - Needs API key
- OpenAI - Needs API key</string>
